57
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:05,000
is formed from the powders. Plutonia is fixed in intimate contact with the

58
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:15,000
Uranium thus maintaining a uniform distribution.

59
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:22,000
The impacted fuel material is 98% of theoretical density or greater, an important factor in

60
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:29,000
