72
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:50,000
The different size fractions help in packing the tube uniformly.

73
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:56,000
Vibratory compaction was developed to load fuel tubes to the desired 85 to 90 percent

74
00:08:56,000 --> 00:09:00,000
