78
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:30,000
A line of hoods is served by one electromagnetic vibratory unit.

79
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:38,000
each hood, a fuel tube is clamped to the bar extending from the drive unit. Then

80
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:45,000
