109
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:44,000
ideal density and to measure electrical resistivity.

110
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:59,000
A determination of thermal conductivity is obtained by subjecting one face of a

111
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:05,000
sample to a laser pulse and recording the temperature rise on the opposite

112
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:16,000
face. In the successive recycle of the mixed oxides of plutonium and uranium,

113
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:22,000
