121
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:29,000
The fuel material is recovered from the melt by electrolysis.

122
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:33,000
The desired plutonium uranium oxide combination,

123
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:42,000
