124
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:52,000
Then, the high density fuel is crushed to yield particles for reloading by vibratory compaction.

125
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Although detailed forecasts of plutonium utilization in a thermal neutron

